# (mixdog-tools computer_app_owned.rs) reads: effect `click_unconfirmed`, `presses`, `pid`, `code`, `text`, `deliveryAccepted`,
# `inputMayHaveExecuted`, and the wheel's `modifiers`. No method, notification or inventory row.
